stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> CREATED
  CREATED --> PREPARING: start
  PREPARING --> AWAITING_ANSWER: plan and first question committed
  AWAITING_ANSWER --> PROCESSING_ANSWER: finalized answer accepted
  PROCESSING_ANSWER --> AWAITING_ANSWER: follow-up or next question committed
  PROCESSING_ANSWER --> FINALIZING: completion policy reached
  AWAITING_ANSWER --> PAUSED: pause
  PAUSED --> AWAITING_ANSWER: resume and reconcile
  FINALIZING --> COMPLETED: report committed
  PREPARING --> FAILED: unrecoverable failure
  PROCESSING_ANSWER --> FAILED: unrecoverable failure
  FAILED --> PREPARING: explicit recovery if safe
  CREATED --> ABANDONED
  AWAITING_ANSWER --> ABANDONED
  PAUSED --> ABANDONED
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  ABANDONED --> [*]
